bluejetty:00078085:ios.description:
Measure anything with Measuring Tape+
Turn your iPhone or iPad into a powerful measuring tool. Using the device's camera, AR technology, and AI, you can easily and quickly measure the size of real objects or large rooms.
Measuring Tape+ is free to download. Some features require a PRO subscription.
Some of the key features:
• AR technology: the AR ruler app uses augmented reality to measure objects by pointing your iPhone or iPad camera at them. Just tap on the screen to place start and end points for digital measurements;
• Enjoy basic measuring features for free or unlock advanced tools, like area measurement, height tool, on-screen ruler, and bubble level, with a PRO subscription;
• Multiple measurement units: choose between different measurement units, including inches, centimeters, and millimeters, so you can choose the one that best suits your needs;
• Measuring Tape provides an opportunity to save and share measurements and keep a history log of all measurements taken, with dates and times.
Join thousands of satisfied users who have transformed their measurement experience with tape measure. Download the app today from the App Store and start measuring precisely and easily.
SUBSCRIPTIONS
The Measuring Tape+ app offers an auto-renewing weekly and yearly subscription to provide you with unlimited access to premium tools, and advanced measurement features. 
More information about the auto-renewal of subscription:
• Free trial, if offered, converts automatically to a paid subscription at the price shown on the purchase screen unless canceled at least 24 hours before the trial ends;
• Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period;
• Subscriptions may be managed by the user and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to the user’s Account Settings after purchase;
• Any unused portion of a free trial period will be forfeited when the user purchases a subscription;
• Payment will be charged to the Apple ID account at confirmation of purchase;
• An account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours before the end of the current period. The cost depends on the selected plan.
_____
