- Recurring transactions: Automatically generate repeating income and expenses such as rent, car payments, subscriptions, insurance, and salary;
- Budget management: Set monthly or yearly budgets, plan spending in advance, and avoid overspending;
- Free backup: Data syncs automatically with your account, continues after switching phones, and can be used on multiple phones;
- Free export: Export transactions at any time, including transaction images to Excel;
- Free import: Import transactions from Alipay, WeChat, and many other platforms;
- Reimbursement management: Record transactions awaiting reimbursement and manage the complete reimbursement process;
- Refunds: Apply refunds to expense transactions, link the complete transaction flow, and support multiple refunds.
- Bulk editing: Process notes, accounts, categories, tags, and other information across multiple transactions
- Tags: Add multiple tags to transactions, such as merchant, project, or city, for multidimensional management.
- Search: Find transactions by amount, time, ledger, tag, category, and other criteria;
- Multiple currencies: Includes 100+ currencies with automatic exchange-rate conversion;
- Widgets: A variety of home screen widgets makes recording more convenient;
- Quick launch mode: Open the app and enter the transaction flow automatically;
- Calendar view: View each day’s data summary clearly on a calendar;
- Privacy first: Protect data with facial authentication or a passcode to prevent access by others;

【Help and Feedback】

User guide: https://docs.qianjiapp.com
Feedback: Submit it through the “Feedback” page in the app.

